  "description": "The Hangout is the ultimate beachfront destination for family-friendly fun, live entertainment, and unforgettable beachside dining. Located in Gulf Shores, AL, we offer direct beach access, free live music, hourly foam parties, and a relaxed coastal atmosphere perfect for families, groups, and celebrations. Pet-friendly with ample seating and convenient parking, The Hangout serves Gulf Coast-inspired cuisine featuring fresh seafood, signature burgers, and handcrafted cocktails. Whether you're here for the food, music, or memories, The Hangout is where everyone feels at home.",
